# "Another target creature gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is Picard's power." Depower makes Picard -2/2, and a
# negative power gives X = 0 (CR 107.1b): the Ornithopter gets +0/+0 and stays a 0/2, not -2/0.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Picard, Leading by Example
Ornithopter
Depower
Island
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

